OL,3,AYemeni government forces say they have
OL,4,A'secured' Bab al-Mandab Strait
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemeni pro-government forces backed by
OL,7,FSaudi Arabia say they have "secured"
OL,8,Fthe Bab al-Mandab Strait at the start
OL,9,Fof a major offensive against the
OL,10,FIran-backed Houthi movement.
OL,12,FA Yemeni military spokesman said Giants
OL,13,FBrigades and National Shield forces
OL,14,Fwere besieging Houthi fighters in the
OL,15,FRed Sea coastal town of Dhubab, which
OL,16,Foverlooks the strategic waterway, after
OL,17,Fthe forces took control of its airport
OL,18,Fand cut the road to the port city
OL,19,FMokha.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
