OL,3,AYemeni government forces say they have
OL,4,A'secured' Bab al-Mandab Strait
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouthi-run media denied that government
OL,7,Fforces had made advances in the Dhubab
OL,8,Farea.
OL,10,FThe government said operations had also
OL,11,Fbegun on several other fronts,
OL,12,Fincluding the capital Sanaa, which fell
OL,13,Fto the Houthis at the start of the
OL,14,Fcivil war 12 years ago.
